From 4b200c7c2487295f04677bccdfa0ac13abd67625 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 17:25:21 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed library item context menu

Reorders and renames the media library item menu as in the redesign's file menu (Play, Mark as Watched, Favorites, Stream, Convert, Add to Queue, Add to Playlist, Show in File Explorer, Properties & Metadata) and gives each entry its two-tone orange icon. Stream and Convert open VLC's streaming wizard with the selected files. Menu entries from QML can now carry an icon name, and a plain "&" in their text is no longer taken as a mnemonic.
